   * @x-autobe-specification Create administrator account through approved promotion workflow. When a member or seller's admin promotion request is approved by a super administrator, this operation creates the admin account record. Validate email uniqueness across all admin accounts. Generate bcrypt password hash from provided password. Set grade based on promotion request type (regular or super). Link to existing member account via member_id. Return JWT access and refresh tokens for immediate authentication. Reject if email already exists in admins table or if promotion request is not in approved state.
